               <text>
                  <paragraph>NDC 24510-050-10<br/>100 Tablets</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>NUCYNTA<sup>®</sup>
                     <br/>(tapentadol) Tablets</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>50 mg 						</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>CII 						</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Each tablet contains:<br/>tapentadol 50 mg</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Caution: Federal law prohibits the transfer<br/>of this drug to any person other than the patient<br/>for whom it was prescribed.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Dispense the accompanying Medication Guide<br/> to each patient. 						</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Rev Dec 2018<br/>NUC-003-C.4</paragraph>
